message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper."
type: software
title: "VividChord"
authors:
  - family-names: Mahdiani
    given-names: Morteza
    email: m72.morteza@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/morteza-mahdiani/imagined-scene-vividness"
abstract: >-
  VividChord. The visual features associated with vivid mental images remain
  poorly understood. Lightweight MLP readouts on frozen vision models predict
  average imagery-vividness ratings for the Natural Scenes Dataset. The best
  model reaches r = 0.376, about 95% of the image-level reliability ceiling,
  and a shared component of 14 models reaches r = 0.378.
